ng in a multiplayer room called “Launch Party,” set to hold 100 people. If you're curious what multiplayer actually feels like when everyone's desktop might be a different size, come on in. Right-click your buddy, open the multiplayer tab, a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:09:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693984","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4662190-1846018067931813","game_id":"steam-4662190","kind":"announcement","title":"The Stress Buddy demo is out","summary":"What's in the demoFuzzy Buddy reacts to you, falls asleep if you ignore him, loves to be scratched (Shift-LMB) and bops along when you play music Red Balloon rises to the top of your screen and can make annoying squeaks when you rub him on the edges of your windows Paper Ball is great for throwing in the Recycle Bin in Trashketball mode Basketball demonstrates how every ball will have uniquely-tuned physics in the full gameFling them, drop them, let them bounce off your windows and the taskbar. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T00:58:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931813","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4662190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:33Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4662190":"2026-10-26T13:17:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4662190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:33Z"},"5205790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:34Z","last_suc